# The repo root contains heavy native deps (sharp, onnxruntime),
# multi-GB extension/models folders and node_modules — none of which
# any Vercel deployment needs. The docs project (Root Directory=docs)
# MUST stay shippable: docs/package.json missing from the upload fails
# the install with ENOENT (seen 2026-09-29). Landing_page/ stays
# shippable for the static landing project.
*
!Landing_page/
!Landing_page/**
!vercel.json
!docs/
!docs/**
